        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The main grounds that were raised on the side of the second petitioner is that there is violation of Section 42 (2) of the Act, since the Food Analyst report was not sent within 14 days from the date of receipt of the sample."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b2a912740b0f45cd9db39163df1146d0_15",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The other ground that was raised is that there was violation of Section 42 (3)\nof the Act, since after receipt of the Food Analyst report, the Designated Officer should send the recommendation within 14 days to the Commissioner of Food Safe"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "70d4341a4f45447e81003da5ea3681d2_16",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nHowever, the Designated Officer received the report on 13.02.2017 and he had sent his recommendation only on 24.01.2018 seeking sanction for prosecution."
      },
      {
