        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "6. The other ground that was raised is violation of Section 46 (4) of the Act, which provides for a right of appeal against the report of the Food Analyst."
