        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "On carefully reading the complaint filed by the respondent, such a right of appeal, at the best was only given to Accused No.1 and there is absolutely no indication as to whether such an opportunity was given to the petitioner (Accused No.2"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "dab67ca512344d9b81768d8313909848_22",
